{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"7c439369581c97a1","type":"text","text":"Born in the city of Cilindrath within the continent of Wildfort Vivianne Lockwood now spends her time in Melonia hoping to work her way up in order to gain a favour from Alura Vysoren The Cobalt Princess. \n\nHer mother Fena Lockwood was kidnapped at a young age by people wearing all black, a hooded cloak, a blindfold and a symbol on their forehead.\n\nHer Father Sergei was gone long before she was born.\n\nAfter her Mother was kidnaped at age 10 Vivianne woke up ten years later in the basement of her home with a stone tablet in her hand about the size of 30 stacked sheets of paper. This tablet has a symbol carved into it with liquid blood flowing through it never spilling. \n\n\nFor 100 years Vivianne has looked for her family or any answers as to what this tablet is. Eventually as time passed she began to become accustom to her lineage she began to develop arcane abilities and the power of a dragon. For 50 years she was stuck walking un familiar lands as a 20 year old orphan elf. Begging for money hoping to find someone who will help her nobody was willing to help, at that time her powers began to show. She spent a long time practicing her magic creating spells with just her will finding ways to fight off people who tried to hurt her and eventually used that magic to escape the destruction of Cilindrath.\nWhile the country around her began to change and show distain for arcane practitioners Vivianne found herself on the run at all times. She attempted to flee the country where she met a woman named Yelrien who showed her a domain called Melonia, a safe place for all who use magic. \n\nVivianne now spends her time trying to impress the higher ups of the political structure with random spells she conjures with no incantations. She has made friends throught the city of Melvain and has caught the attention of Alura a few times but not enough for the favour she seeks. \n\nViviannes goals are to find her mother and uncover the mystery of her family history, the power of this dragon and the tablet.\n","x":-500,"y":-320,"width":980,"height":620},
		{"id":"4546aacf348ae45e","type":"text","text":"[[Vivianne Lockwood.canvas]]\n#PlayerCharacter ","x":-561,"y":-444,"width":250,"height":60}
